{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_04_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3b8fdecd154f8f522be0741d62df2c440ede4b437ed761f20d5224ba590f156d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44cddfe0281b8f12a44bcb057ba591e369ee11506f1ae62b6d90f5311bea8bae",
      "text": "就是所谓的Variety啦！比如，\n当client需要adult又sexy的image时？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8b9f8474e026188b23783a82529f7599095478f52533cd6214603825d1088e",
      "text": "如果只有年轻的idol，\n难得的offer可就接不下来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce18e654a09fbd6a1af4bfbf176c326794b72a296ee836cf46799c7c35b6c850",
      "text": "但是，如果有像我们这样的人在事务所里，\n那种时候说不定就能派上用场哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3556017419f6503f2cdf327f4e98d075529363b0846465200ab7ecc79910d20",
      "text": "而且我们可是前teachers！这份career，\n在偶像的世界里说不定也能成为武器吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e33a6641064a7b25398cb5a5d08cf3898fc5d17b93629335fc61c4a0253a14",
      "text": "（大概是因为在学校里经常和很多人说话吧。谈吐太优秀了，让人忍不住想听他说得更多！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6829704107a2d820c86ebb61be00034a5cd8e9fb312dd2629e83766a284f1fb",
      "text": "我想再多听听二位的故事！\n贤君，不好意思……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26727fdab68af63bcd7ec49cecd33400472891dbe45b1ef7498881c68c68591",
      "text": "我们想重启试镜，\n能麻烦你准备一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0584d47a40f5ee54a3218241be556a4cfd4b4099effc42cdc192231b6c11518c",
      "text": "当然，前提是二位时间方便的话……\n不知意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6814b9add2d4e9fca779254bbe9adb18494443a6fcf1d7d5f203157cf2da828",
      "text": "……诶。这么说，\n是现在就能给我们办试镜的意思吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81e08f11861b204ae6d7c7db7a4dad0f36164e70bb5e3319240ee6b34748c255",
      "text": "要做要做！我们两个时间完全no problem☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:819186026a34433c39c10147ce485e6f3aa97b811d78cbc0f236f2df4dfb11fb",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，这可是big chance哦。\n是只为我们准备的特别试镜啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a650ad5498a57735b8375412be8899e4262548bf48f67b38cce4cb14876b32ba",
      "text": "Hurry, hurry！\n得赶紧call Mr. 硲叫他过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8665f6ee83d6fa24a7e5f46a709965bd8923219d68c7252473466586f4ffd543",
      "text": "诶？啊、也是呢。\n那个，手机手机……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
